# Safe-mode D7 (plans/backlog/SAFE_MODE.md §3 0c): `.unwrap()` on an
# Option/Result receiver in a SAFE file is a compile error - the call
# discards failure information the type already gave the caller and would
# abort on the failure case. The variable/call-result form here is caught by
# the property-access metadata gate or the dispatch-time gate in
# calls/function.yo (whichever sees the receiver first; the diagnostic is
# identical). Recorded by hand: the recording binary must carry the gate.
stdout_keep_match=discards the failure case
timeout=300
